			<div class="content" id="post-content-4409411">
									

<p>I was on board until the final note. While it makes sense in-universe, it pretty much beats you over the head with what the anomaly is. The article does a good job of hinting at what it is while keeping a sense of mystery to it, but the final note kills the mystery and turns the article rather dull.</p>
<p>Novote.</p>

